Integration tests share one binary and workspace fixtures.

Add a test file under tests/suite/ and register it in tests/main.rs:

    #[path = "suite/new_module.rs"]
    mod new_module;

Import shared fixtures with `use crate::common;` rather than declaring
`mod common;` in a test module. `common::lexicon()` and `common::ENVIRONMENT`
load the workspace Lexicon and compile its Grammar once for the binary.
Custom Lexicons remain local to the tests that need them.

Run one module with:

    cargo test -p deckmaste_english_v3 --test main new_module::
